                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99f033c8-1b82-4d9a-b42f-b4f071da70a1",
                                                "sense_id": "b3908eb0-defa-3de6-a3b9-21de69c52706",
                                                "text": "A balloon collapses when the gas escapes from it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65424de7-8797-327e-87e2-879fd328a92d",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cease to function due to a sudden breakdown; to fail suddenly and completely."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1186ce2-9b05-45e6-955d-5382d93c079a",
                                                "sense_id": "65424de7-8797-327e-87e2-879fd328a92d",
                                                "text": "Pyramid schemes tend to generate profits for a while and then collapse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f71a013-9dcc-4ff3-9f9c-a9b227b51aa4",
                                                "sense_id": "65424de7-8797-327e-87e2-879fd328a92d",
                                                "text": "However much we like to think of ourselves as something special in world history, in fact industrial societies are subject to the same principles that caused earlier societies to collapse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fad384f-4b33-3d56-a5f4-d09b2a4ec7b4",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fold compactly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab9c7a69-9338-3f59-b6cf-6d645c9c07d4",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a hierarchical list (such as a directory tree or table of contents), to hide the subentries of (an entry)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27ffff26-ce65-3de2-874d-b006547842ec",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To suffer a batting collapse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "570edfd0-52d2-4e62-ba35-4a71e307f3fb",
                                                "sense_id": "27ffff26-ce65-3de2-874d-b006547842ec",
                                                "text": "Immediately after his wicket the team collapsed for 69."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5d9a018-3991-3044-b085-292788b05120",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause something to collapse."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20d5af7b-71c2-4cbe-8b1e-9f0dc72249a8",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d9a018-3991-3044-b085-292788b05120",
                                                "text": "Hurry up and collapse the tent so we can get moving."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3052901b-cda9-49c8-8142-87361f3ea901",
                                                "sense_id": "a5d9a018-3991-3044-b085-292788b05120",
                                                "text": "Thomas added: \"We presented our experiences of frantically trying to collapse a pram, surrounded by loads of grumpy commuters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c4b4b57-78c6-3039-963c-7a3cf672543d",
                                        "entry_id": "0196bd97-34ef-31a9-8c35-882029922615",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pass out and fall to the floor or ground, as from exhaustion or other illness; to faint."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0c69e3d-fdc5-4d21-a0da-bca125581cea",
                                                "sense_id": "2c4b4b57-78c6-3039-963c-7a3cf672543d",
                                                "text": "The exhausted singer collapsed on stage and had to be taken to the hospital."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
